---
title: "Don't Fear the Model Router"
subTitle: "Route to the best model with confidence."
date: 2026-07-02
modified: 2026-09-04
tags: [ai, llm, agents, mastra, evals, model-routing, testing, observability, production]
category: AI
subCategory: AI Infrastructure
popularity: 0.84
